  "details": "The ability to tune the physics of the drone is incredible, it allows the ability to create different flight characteristics for different purposes between things like filming in small spaces to racing around in large environments.\n\nI feel that the bounds of the physics sliders do not go far enough. For instance, I would love to have more power on the motors, be able to turn off air drag entirely if I want, as well as significantly alter the mass of the drone.",
